If you modify Line 24 and Line 28 with the specific customer details, you can configure this script as a PowerShell script to run as a Workstation Platform script in Intune.

Line 24 = the customer number - This will be the first four numbers in the file name of the windows agent file if downloaded from within the client's INC portal.
Line 28 = Define which INC instance the client is in.

This script will negate the old method of needing to update the INC token using the MSI install method. It can be used to replace this older method, 
as it will automatically grab the new token when it is issued.

When configuring in Intune you need the following options:

Run this script using the logged on credentials = No
Enforce script signature check = No
Run script in 64 bit PowerShell Host = Yes